    """Compile authored text into typed symbols. Punctuation => *candidate* rests.

    [A] to [Z] => explicit silence type, {cat} => SFX cue, words => pitches.
    Ordinary punctuation does not prove intent. An ellipsis is type E by
    notation convention, never automatically established as catalytic Z.
